# Purpose
Show how to use the Research space for sources actually consulted this turn,
including source medium, research method, topic/genre, purpose and findings.
Explain declaration provenance, safe links, filtering and turn ownership.
# Source review
Native Research renderer and tests were inspected. Risk: implementation
details and local/private source references. Rewrite-only public guidance;
include the supported authoring contract, neutral examples and user controls.
Exclude internal routes, repositories, local identities and deployment details.
# Verification
Matched to strict native parser, real panel lifecycle tests and Chromium
phone/Fold/tablet/landscape checks. Example is illustrative, not a research receipt.
